## Step out onto your balcony

A chic and comfortable double with your own balcony. Inside: a comfortable double bed, Nespresso coffee and an en-suite with a walk-in shower. Outside: your own spot for morning coffee or a glass of wine in the evening, looking out over the neighbourhood.
